      "title": {
        "en": "Knowledgeable associates and friendly clerks"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Shoppers regularly commend the store associates, highlighting employees like Jason and Mati for their product expertise and helpfulness with newly adopted rescue puppies. Reviewers appreciate quick, courteous service at checkout, though two critical reviewers noted occasional negative customer interactions and a frustrating grooming salon cancellation."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 11,
      "title": {
        "en": "Tidy neighborhood shop with dog wash"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Visitors appreciate the convenient neighborhood store format, describing it as well-stocked, clean, and easy to navigate with leashed pets. Multiple reviewers particularly praise the self-service dog wash station that provides necessary cleaning supplies on site, though one customer noted a minor store odor during their visit."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 4,
      "title": {
        "en": "Welcoming atmosphere for visiting dogs"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners value the pet-friendly environment where leashed dogs are warmly welcomed inside the store. Reviewers note that staff members show genuine care toward visiting dogs, assisting owners with properly fitted training collars, puppy nutrition supplies, and self-grooming resources for pets of various sizes."
      }
    }
  ],
